# Every file in the project is owned by the maintainer.
#
# GitHub reads this to auto-request review on every pull request, which is the
# mechanical half of what CONTRIBUTING.md states in prose: Jackdaw is
# maintained by one person and pull requests are accepted selectively. Pair it
# with branch protection on main ("Require a pull request before merging" +
# "Require review from Code Owners") so the rule is enforced rather than
# advertised.
#
# Auto-request activates on public repositories and on private ones under a
# paid plan; on a free private repo the file is inert but harmless, and starts
# working the day the repository goes public.

